      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really that bad though, just a little tender when I press it. i'd rather not spend a bunch of money on a doctor visit if i can avoid it. do u think there are any specific anti-inflammatories or something i should take to help the swelling go down faster? maybe just a higher dose of ibuprofen?",
